# Long-form documentation for this fork. Upstream's prettier config collapses
# each paragraph onto one line, which makes a one-word change rewrite the whole
# paragraph and turns the diff of a spec into noise. These are hand-wrapped and
# reviewed as prose; prettier still owns the code and config files.
AGENTS.md
CHANGELOG.md
CLAUDE.md
DEVELOPMENT.md
HANDOFF.md
deploy.md
deploy-spec.md
dedupe-plan.md
BUILD_PROGRESS.md
WORKSPACE_TRANSFER.md
PRODUCTION_QA_REPORT_*.md
excalidraw-*.md
background-removal-specification.md
docs/specs/
server/README.md

# The API is a separate deployable: plain Node ESM, not the editor's React and
# TypeScript. Running the editor's rules over it reports 749 warnings and no
# errors — almost all brace style, import order and string concatenation, which
# is the server's own consistent style rather than a defect. Linting it belongs
# with a config of its own; reformatting it to the editor's rules inside an
# unrelated pull request does not.
server/
